PARITY MAPPING (web → native)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  shell:   <FadeIn> + section card
             → TSFadeIn(delay:0.2) + tokenized glass card (Color.TS.surface +
               TSRadius.lg + Color.TS.border stroke).
  props:   CONTROLLED component — parent owns sessions/filteredSessions/sort/filter/
           search/pagination/bulk plumbing
             → SessionListModel owns load state (via SessionListSource P1/S8) PLUS the
               view-local control state; the filter→sort→page pipeline is computed by
               the pure SessionListProjection and unit-tested once.
  data:    SI on disk (total_energy_added_wh / peak_power_w …) → kWh/kW derived only
           at the read boundary, exactly like the web `…_wh / 1000`.
  states:  isLoading → 5 <Skeleton> rows ; !sessions.length → <EmptyState "No charging
           sessions yet"> ; filteredSessions.length===0 → <EmptyState "No sessions
           match your filters"> ; else search + controls + cards + Pagination
             → SessionListProjection.resolvePhase → .loading/.empty/.error/.content;
               within .content, hasNoMatches renders SessionNoMatchesState while the
               controls stay visible (web inner branch).
  search:  <SearchInput placeholder="Search by location or charger type…">
             → SessionSearchField (bound TextField, prompt via P1/S10 key, clear btn).
  chips:   <ActiveFilterChips> (search + charger, onClearAll)
             → SessionActiveChips + SessionChipToken (removable, "Clear all").
  filter:  All / Home / SC / DC ghost pills (chargerFilter)
             → SessionChargerFilterBar + SessionPillButton (active = isSelected trait).
  sort:    Date / kWh / Cost / Time / Power pills; active shows ↓/↑ (handleSortClick:
           re-tap toggles direction)
             → SessionSortBar + model.selectSort (toggle desc on same key).
  export:  <a href=/api/v1/export/charging?format=csv&start=&end=&vehicle_id= download>
             → SessionExportButtons → model.export → SessionListExport.path (byte-for-
               byte port) → SessionListExporter seam (no view-side networking).
  bulk:    <BulkActionsToolbar> delete with confirm "Delete {{count}} {{noun}}?" /
           "This cannot be undone."
             → SessionBulkToolbar + confirmationDialog; model.deleteSelected() awaits
               the SessionListDeleter seam then clears selection; noun pluralized.
  row:     <ChargingSessionCard> — ScoreBadge, TimeStamp · duration · category Badge ·
           kWh Badge · Free Badge, RouteDisplay(location), InlineMetrics(BatteryDelta,
           peak kW, ~avg kW, duration, cost, cost/kWh, +distance)
             → SessionRow + SessionScoreBadge/SessionCategoryBadge/SessionBadge/
               SessionMetricChip; badges + metrics wrap via SessionFlowLayout
               (web flex-wrap). Distance via SessionListUnits seam (web toDistanceDisplay).
  page:    <Pagination page/pageSize/total onPageChange/onPageSizeChange>
             → SessionPaginationBar over SessionPage/SessionPaginator (client-side
               window: range readout + page-size menu + prev/next bounded).
  i18n:    every web t(key,default) → SessionListStrings facade, table "SessionListSection".

STATES (every one renders — no hidden surface):
  loading  → SessionLoadingState (5 TSSkeleton rows; reduce-motion safe)
  empty    → SessionEmptyState (ContentUnavailableView, web "No charging sessions yet")
  no-match → SessionNoMatchesState (controls stay; web "No sessions match your filters")
  error    → SessionErrorState (QueryError-equiv, Retry → model.refresh())
  content  → search + chips + header + controls + bulk toolbar + rows + pager
  stale    → freshness chip (Stale) + SessionConnectivityBanner + ONE guarded auto-refresh
  offline  → freshness chip (Offline) + banner; keeps cached rows, no refetch
a11y: container summary (title + filtered count), per-row VoiceOver value (date ·
  charger · kWh · cost/Free · duration), selection/sort pills carry isSelected trait,
  every interactive control has an accessibilityLabel, Dynamic Type via system fonts/
  tokens, reduce-motion honored by TSFadeIn/TSSkeleton.
telemetry: P1/S11 view.opened(surface:"SessionListSection") emitted once on appear.
binding: P1/S8 SessionListSource seam (production over shared charging state holder);
  the view performs NO networking. Previews/tests drive InMemorySessionListSource.

